        "url": "https://longreads.com/2026/07/16/religious-devotion-child-death/",
        "content_text": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?fit=1024%2C683&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"Two hands holding a card made by a child.\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?w=2560&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2560w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=768%2C512&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=1536%2C1024&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=2048%2C1365&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=1200%2C800&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=2000%2C1333&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=780%2C520&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=400%2C267&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?resize=706%2C471&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?w=2340&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1 2340w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/KerrFamily_RMorton-140-scaled.jpg?fit=1024%2C683&amp;quality=89&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure>The Kerrs were devoted to one another and to their faith. But when one of their own rejected modern medicine, they faced a dire question: What if her children ever needed a doctor to save their lives?",
