        "content_text": "<figure><img width=\"1024\" height=\"725\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?fit=1024%2C725&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"attachment-rss-image-size size-rss-image-size wp-post-image\" alt=\"two-panel image of author Kyle Devine on left and &quot;Recomposed&quot; book cover image on the right\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?w=2400&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 2400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=300%2C213&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=1024%2C725&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=768%2C544&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=1536%2C1088&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=2048%2C1451&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=1200%2C850&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=2000%2C1417&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 2000w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=780%2C553&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 780w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=400%2C283&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 400w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?resize=706%2C500&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 706w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?w=2340&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1 2340w, https://i0.wp.com/longreads.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Recomposed-Kyle-Devine-vinyl-record.png?fit=1024%2C725&amp;quality=80&amp;ssl=1&amp;w=370 370w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 34.9rem) calc(100vw - 2rem), (max-width: 53rem) calc(8 * (100vw / 12)), (min-width: 53rem) calc(6 * (100vw / 12)), 100vw\" /></figure>Behind the nostalgia lies an uncomfortable truth: Every record is made of oil.",
