        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://alman.ai/\">Alman</a> is a simplified dialect of German designed to reduce the complexity of the language while maintaining mutual intelligibility with Standard German. It systematically eliminates several complex grammatical features ... This makes Alman easier to learn while remaining fully comprehensible to Standard German speakers.",
