        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/this-week-in-ai-chips-checks-and-changing-jobs/",
        "content_text": "This week data and AI evangelist Christina Stathopoulos returned for a solo news briefing. Instead of exploring one or two topics in depth, Christina sorted the week&#8217;s headlines into a handful of threads: advances in physical hardware to keep up with AI demand, the widening reach of government oversight into frontier model companies, and a [&#8230;]",
