        "title": "Prompt Injection to Data Exfil in 3 Hops",
        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/prompt-injection-to-data-exfil-in-3-hops/",
        "content_text": "The incident that should worry you makes no destructive call. Nothing is deleted, nothing crashes, no alert fires. An employee asks an agent to summarise a customer ticket; the agent does exactly that, the user gets a useful answer, and somewhere, in the same second, a customer record leaves the cluster over an ordinary HTTPS [&#8230;]",
