        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/17/apple-reclaims-most-valuable-company-title-from-nvidia-as-it-barrels-toward-5t/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/05/tim-cook-wwdc26-keynote-wave.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple has officially reclaimed the world’s most valuable company title based on market cap. The company overtook Nvidia during intraday trading on Friday with its stock up 17 points this week. </p>",
